   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "Good, you've learned which end to hold. Take your Wooden Pickaxe to plain rock outside the walls, then craft a Stone Axe and a Stone Pickaxe and bring both for inspection. I'll swap them for a fresh pair; the next rock won't yield to wood and encouragement.",
   "giver": "r14_dwarf_elder",
   "giver_name": "Brunna Flintbraid",
