  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "I know a dragging footstep after a hard shift, and those aren't tired miners. Kill eight Braindead Zombies on the Hearthpine Shingle south from here after nightfall. They burn in sunlight, so get your daytime work done while you wait. The dead can have your next shift.",
