  {
   "copper": 3,
   "description": "The rats have eaten at my expense and chewed through my flour sacks, so they can pay for the mending. Bring me two Rat Fur Patches from the Large Rats in the Hearthpine Timberline after nightfall.",
   "giver": "r20_dwarf_start_cook",
