   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 7,
   "description": "Young Ibex are kicking slate onto the path through the Hearthpine High Pines, which lie in the southwest of Hearthpine Vale. Hunt eight by day; they'll graze peaceably until you start the fight. Our skulls are sturdy, but I'd rather not test them against the whole hillside.",
