   "title": "A Hard Hat Has Limits",
   "turnin": "r14_dwarf_elder",
   "xp": 193
  },
  {
   "copper": 4,
   "description": "When the snow shuts us in, I mean to hear snoring, not stomachs. Bring me ten pieces of Raw Meat for the winter racks; what you've saved counts, or hunt boar and ibex by day and rats by night here in Hearthpine Vale. I'll send you off with three portions of Meat, because the cook gets the last word on leaving hungry.",
