  {
   "copper": 4,
   "description": "A shaft prop is only as trustworthy as its fittings, and miners put their lives beneath ours. Smelt three Copper Bars and three Tin Bars from the local ore and bring them to me. I'll give you a Dual Furnace for your own work. Place it outside protected ground.",
