  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "For once I'd like a feast that nobody can mistake for yesterday's stew. Bring me three Crab Legs from Small Crabs or Monstrous Crabs at the Hearthpine Rockpools southwest from here by day. Small Crabs leave you alone until provoked; Monstrous Crabs start the argument themselves, so keep all your fingers for the cutlery.",
