   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Feast Fights Back",
   "turnin": "r20_dwarf_start_cook",
   "xp": 150
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "Those Copper Bars and Tin Bars are holding up mine shafts now, so you'll need fresh supplies for this. Use your Dual Furnace to make three Bronze Bars and bring them to me here. You've earned a Bronze Pickaxe and a crack at tougher rock; remember who taught you when you strike something worth bragging about.",
