   "copper": 9,
   "description": "Bracket has written our ore into his ledger as though stealing it were a trade. Go to the Hearthpine Thieves' Camp northeast from here, where his crew lurks day and night, and defeat seven Confused Ore Thieves and Confused Ore Chief Bracket himself. Draw the chief away from his crew if you can; you've done enough honest work to know the value of coming home.",
